WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.400
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.200
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.567
Let's find OUT!

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:06.633
Alright,

00:00:06.633 --> 00:00:08.200
a number series!

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:08.733
Six,

00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:09.233
eight,

00:00:09.233 --> 00:00:09.767
ten,

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:10.300
twelve,

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.333
and then...

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:12.900
what comes next?

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:13.433
A.

00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:13.967
Fourteen,

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:14.500
B.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Twelve,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.533
C.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:16.067
Sixteen,

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:17.100
or D.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:17.633
Fifteen?

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:18.667
Five seconds!

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:25.133
TIME'S UP!

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:25.933
It's...

00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:26.267
A,

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:26.633
fourteen!

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:28.733
Each number goes up by two,

00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:30.833
so the next one is twelve

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:32.267
plus two is fourteen.

00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:33.300
Alright!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.967
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:36.500
A.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.033
Purple,

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:37.567
B.

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:38.100
Circle,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:38.633
C.

00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:39.167
Yellow,

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:40.233
or D.

00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:40.767
Red?

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:41.833
Five seconds!

00:00:47.233 --> 00:00:48.300
TIME'S UP!

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:49.167
It's...

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:49.567
B,

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:50.000
circle!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:50.433
Red,

00:00:50.433 --> 00:00:50.833
yellow,

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:52.533
and purple are colors.

00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:54.633
A circle is a shape,

00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:56.733
so it does not belong.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.367
Here's one,

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.000
a number puzzle,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.667
and it's sneaky!

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:04.967
If three plus five makes twenty-four,

00:01:04.967 --> 00:01:07.700
one plus three makes twelve,

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.433
five plus four makes twenty-seven,

00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:13.200
then six plus four makes...

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:13.733
what?

00:01:13.733 --> 00:01:14.300
A.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:14.833
Thirty,

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:15.400
B.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:15.933
Ten,

00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:16.500
C.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:17.033
Forty,

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:18.133
or D.

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:18.667
Twenty?

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:19.767
Five seconds!

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:26.233
TIME'S UP!

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:27.867
The answer is...

00:01:27.867 --> 00:01:28.267
A,

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:28.667
thirty!

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:31.100
The trick is to add the

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:31.900
two numbers,

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:32.700
then triple:

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.700
six plus four is ten,

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:36.333
times three is thirty.

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:37.200
So,

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.000
are you smart or fart?

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.200
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.267
find your rank!

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.100
So,

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.333
how did you do?

00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:45.567
Comment your score below,

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:46.800
and follow for more!
